  "bodyHash": "6dc54524086a1582",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/86c557fa066738eba849fb55c4db9f2fc1e4369e.png\" alt=\"新鮮食物\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/YqKBQtWE9T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1371956415479939173?style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&color=728ADA\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@swip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCgbhEot28IcFLwTiArTJXeg?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white&label=Youtube&color=FF0034\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道訂閱數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1238490?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=curseforge&color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/UoLAbzII?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth&color=1CD96A\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/iamcyberia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/followers/iamcyberia?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&label=Github\" alt=\"GitHub 追蹤者\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/899c0e364c509449cd21d46c78cd5a7775ff9951.png\" alt=\"說明\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這個資源包徹底將遊戲中的所有食物項目重新打造為自訂的 3D 模型，賦予它們急需的視覺魅力。預設情況下，介面、物品展示框和地面模型將保持 2D，因此可與修改圖案的資源包（如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fanimated-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Animated Textures</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdetail-brush\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Detail Brush</a>）相容。不過，如果你更想使用這些物品的 3D 版本，也可以透過安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RespackOpts</a> 來實現！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此外，每種食物都擁有獨特的食用動畫！蘋果是邊轉邊啃食的，魚類食用時下方會露出魚骨，還有更多細節等你發掘。（……或者說，等你享用）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在本次最新更新中，所有食物類型都新增了可命名的變體版本，讓你能夠將其放置在物品展示框中，看起來就像食物真的擺在桌上一樣。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我該如何取得食物的盤裝變體？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/iamcyberia/fresh-food/blob/master/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a97c15f503729d779fc6f2f2a9eeec71ff7d2dd4_0.webp\" alt=\"物品列表\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7O6CWgewc3I\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fhq2897wdafu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab8a431924048c60b1386c9524ffab14d7be9c12.jpeg\" alt=\"Ember Host\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本資源包由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fember.host%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ember Host</a> 贊助。點擊上方圖片或使用折扣碼 <strong>\"CYBER\"</strong>，即可於首次購買時享受 10% 折扣！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">選擇 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fember.host%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ember Host</a> 來託管你的 Minecraft 伺服器，充分利用其強大的 AMD 處理器，並以極具競爭力的價格獲得超越期待的體驗！</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6570fc1c8af37836ab6d9863e9b10a47862ff43.png\" alt=\"重要提示\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>推薦模組：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhold-my-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7973e4bec682af65b679ea7723d4efc40fd756a5_0.webp\" alt=\"Hold My Items\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/03d2e11e5df263c6fefdbdb4516e853dfcc71500_0.webp\" alt=\"RespackOpts\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnot-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe83d7884470e5dc62c0f493c7c55d571512d0fb_0.webp\" alt=\"Not Enough Animations\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstewdrinksound\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b2c473d1eadf4df79b39c6a0bf42c5547936fdd8_0.webp\" alt=\"StewDrinkSounds\" width=\"30%\">&nbsp;</a></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21.5 及以下版本所需模組</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7b4cce0eaf26b087b4f5558da97693137287ae07_0.webp\" alt=\"Modefite\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpuzzle\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe555dd0bdf65703c4aed38e303192757bea028d_0.webp\" alt=\"Puzzle\" width=\"30%\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconnector\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/14796f43c681efd5376322b5e79903c3cde93de7_0.webp\" alt=\"Sinytra Connector\" width=\"30%\"></a></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-x-fresh-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ad08d536afb70ea04c5c670734f0dcc25426dd9b.png\" alt=\"Fresh Food x Bare Bones\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f8b6e383aea47901c3b3b0bc3cc4aed78bebacf7.png\" alt=\"即將推出\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">更多可命名變體。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">部分模型的紋理重製。</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af5cdff06b99e6c7ba21ae04072e98688dd2674b.png\" alt=\"額外資訊\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbraysworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Braytonks</a>，不僅製作能力出色，教學解說也一級棒！特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fHellay)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellay)</a> 為部分物品製作貼圖與紋理。特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fweskerson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weskerson</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ftixork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dani</a> 提供核心着色器！以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcubert1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cubert</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpatovskiz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pato</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fHellay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellay</a> 成為我的朋友 :)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">最後但同等重要的是，我要感謝我的 Discord 伺服器中的所有測試人員，你們在提供反饋和尋找 Bug 方面給予了我巨大的幫助！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>所有測試人員：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fQuackingQuark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">QuackingQuark</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcapybaranamed2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Capybaranamed2</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fICE_MASTER\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ICE MASTER</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcommunist_lemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">communist_lemon</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAchtari\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Achtari</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmidvightmirage_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">midvightmirage_</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252frjwaslive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">rjwaslive</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPhillWer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PhillWer</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fsudl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sudl</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fdevicestation4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hours.wav</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">RB</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Duckman</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252falballam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yousef</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPrinceInah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prince Inah</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
